<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>tree6316mte – 블로그</title><link>https://tree6316mte.github.io/</link><description>Recent content in 블로그 on tree6316mte</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>ko</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://tree6316mte.github.io/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>[TIL] 단기심화 9기 3일차</title><link>https://tree6316mte.github.io/til/2026/2026-09-02/</link><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tree6316mte.github.io/til/2026/2026-09-02/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-0.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;어제 필요해 보이는 것들을 북마크해서 바로 들어갈 수 있게 정리를 잘했다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;오늘 8시 58분쯤 되자 북마크 순서대로 QR 출석체크 한다음 잽에 들어가고 온보딩 트래커 키고 체크하면서 코드카타로 하루를 시작했다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이후 코드타카를 끝내고 &lt;strong&gt;Spring 입문 강의&lt;/strong&gt;를 듣는데 &lt;strong&gt;웹CS와 Java입문 강의&lt;/strong&gt;와는 다르게 정리가 필요해 보여서 밑에 정리를 했다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Spring 입문 강의&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="spring-입문-강의"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#spring-%ec%9e%85%eb%ac%b8-%ea%b0%95%ec%9d%98" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;먼저 프로젝트를 만들 때&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;세팅&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="세팅"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ec%84%b8%ed%8c%85" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-1-1.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;먼저 프로젝트 생성할 때 반드시 Spring Boot를 클릭해준다&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-1.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol start="2"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;생성 시 세팅은 Spring Web과 Lombok을 추가해준다&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-2.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol start="3"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;이후 설정을 열어서 자동 가져오기를 켜준다&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-3.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol start="4"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;우측 메뉴에 gradle 버튼 눌러서 gradle설정창을 킬 수 있음&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-3-1.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol start="5"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;gradle설정은 Grovy나 Kotlin 언어로 작성 가능(강의에선 Grovy언어로 작성)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-4.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol start="6"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;필요한 라이브러리가 있다면 gradle설정의 dependencies에 입력 후 아이콘 버튼 누르면 이렇게 외부 라이브러리에 다운&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;HTTP란&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="http란"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#http%eb%9e%80" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Request시에 Response 하는 것&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-overflow-x-auto hx-mt-6 hx-flex hx-rounded-lg hx-border hx-py-2 ltr:hx-pr-4 rtl:hx-pl-4 contrast-more:hx-border-current contrast-more:dark:hx-border-current hx-border-orange-100 hx-bg-orange-50 hx-text-orange-800 dark:hx-border-orange-400/30 dark:hx-bg-orange-400/20 dark:hx-text-orange-300"&gt;
&lt;div class="ltr:hx-pl-3 ltr:hx-pr-2 rtl:hx-pr-3 rtl:hx-pl-2"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-w-full hx-min-w-0 hx-leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-mt-6 hx-leading-7 first:hx-mt-0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Method&lt;/code&gt;: 요청 방식 GET POST DELETE PUT PATCH&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;Header&lt;/code&gt;: 요청이나 응답에 대한 Meta데이터 (부가 설명 데이터)&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;Payload&lt;/code&gt;: 서버와 주고받는 핵심 데이터 (POST, PUT, PATCH에서 사용 가능)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;테스트용 API&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="테스트용-api"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ed%85%8c%ec%8a%a4%ed%8a%b8%ec%9a%a9-api" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-4-1.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;API 여기에 파일을 만든 뒤 아래와 같은 코드를 작성&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx-relative hx-mt-6 first:hx-mt-0 hx-group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@RestController&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;HelloController&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@GetMapping&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;/api/hello&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;hello&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(){&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;Hello World!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx-opacity-0 hx-transition group-hover/code:hx-opacity-100 hx-flex hx-gap-1 hx-absolute hx-m-[11px] hx-right-0 hx-top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx-group/copybtn hx-transition-all active:hx-opacity-50 hx-bg-primary-700/5 hx-border hx-border-black/5 hx-text-gray-600 hover:hx-text-gray-900 hx-rounded-md hx-p-1.5 dark:hx-bg-primary-300/10 dark:hx-border-white/10 dark:hx-text-gray-400 dark:hover:hx-text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
&gt;
&lt;div class="copy-icon group-[.copied]/copybtn:hx-hidden hx-pointer-events-none hx-h-4 hx-w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="success-icon hx-hidden group-[.copied]/copybtn:hx-block hx-pointer-events-none hx-h-4 hx-w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이렇게 코드를 작성 후 Get방식으로 호출 시 Response에서 Hello World!가 반환된다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;테스트 코드&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="테스트-코드"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%ed%85%8c%ec%8a%a4%ed%8a%b8-%ec%bd%94%eb%93%9c" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Junit을 이용하여 테스트 해볼 수 있다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-5.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;테스트를 할 클래스 위에서 우클릭할 시 테스트 만들 수 있다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-6.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이곳에 테스트 코드가 만들어지고 단독 실행 가능함(Junit)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-7.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;해당위치에서 실행하려면 왼촉 초록색 실행 버튼을 클릭해서 실행된다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-8.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;밑에 창이 뜨고 실행이 다 됬을 때, 테스트 통과 체크하면 결과만 볼 수도 있다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lombok&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="lombok"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#lombok" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;java프로젝트 진행 시 필요한 메서드나 생성자 등을 자동으로 생성해주는 좋은 친구이다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-9.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;일단 설정에서 어노테이션 처리 활성화를 킨다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-10.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;만약 처음 Spring 세팅할 때 설치를 안했다면 plugin에서 다시 설치하는게 가능하다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-11.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lombok 어노테이션 사용 방법은 위와 같이 사용된다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-overflow-x-auto hx-mt-6 hx-flex hx-rounded-lg hx-border hx-py-2 ltr:hx-pr-4 rtl:hx-pl-4 contrast-more:hx-border-current contrast-more:dark:hx-border-current hx-border-orange-100 hx-bg-orange-50 hx-text-orange-800 dark:hx-border-orange-400/30 dark:hx-bg-orange-400/20 dark:hx-text-orange-300"&gt;
&lt;div class="ltr:hx-pl-3 ltr:hx-pr-2 rtl:hx-pr-3 rtl:hx-pl-2"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-w-full hx-min-w-0 hx-leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-mt-6 hx-leading-7 first:hx-mt-0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;@Getter&lt;/code&gt; : get 함수 자동생성&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;@Setter&lt;/code&gt; : set 함수 자동생성&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;@AllArgsConstructor&lt;/code&gt; : 멤버변수 모두 받는 생성자 자동생성&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;@NoArgsConstructor&lt;/code&gt; : 멤버변수를 받지 않는 생성자 자동생성&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;@RequiredArgsConstructor&lt;/code&gt; : final이 붙은 멤버변수를 받는 생성자 자동생성&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Spring 설정&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="spring-설정"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#spring-%ec%84%a4%ec%a0%95" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Spring Boot에서 자동으로 설정하고 있는 값을 수동으로 수정할 때 사용&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-12.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;
대략적인 위치 &lt;code&gt;src &amp;gt; main &amp;gt; resources &amp;gt; application.properties&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;application.yml&lt;/code&gt;라는 형식으로도 이 파일을 관리 할 수 있으나 그건 Spring에서 기본적으로 설정하는게 아니라 추가적인 작업이 필요해서 해당 강의에서는 다루지 않음&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Spring MVC란?&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="spring-mvc란"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#spring-mvc%eb%9e%80" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;수동으로 Servlet설정 하던 걸 이젠 Spring MVC 개념을 도입하여 자동으로 해준다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style="color:#F08080;"&gt;도입 전&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="도입-전"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%eb%8f%84%ec%9e%85-%ec%a0%84" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-13.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="text-align: center; color: gray; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 20px;"&gt; 도입 이전에 클라이언트 요청이 들어왔을때 서버의 Servlet이 어떻게 동작하는지 보여주는 사진 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-overflow-x-auto hx-mt-6 hx-flex hx-rounded-lg hx-border hx-py-2 ltr:hx-pr-4 rtl:hx-pl-4 contrast-more:hx-border-current contrast-more:dark:hx-border-current hx-border-blue-200 hx-bg-blue-100 hx-text-blue-900 dark:hx-border-blue-200/30 dark:hx-bg-blue-900/30 dark:hx-text-blue-200"&gt;
&lt;div class="ltr:hx-pl-3 ltr:hx-pr-2 rtl:hx-pr-3 rtl:hx-pl-2"&gt;&lt;div class="hx-select-none hx-text-xl" style="font-family: 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';"&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-w-full hx-min-w-0 hx-leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-mt-6 hx-leading-7 first:hx-mt-0"&gt;Request(클라이언트 요청) -&amp;gt; Servlet(각종 로직 처리) -&amp;gt; Response(서버 응답)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spring MVC를 쓰지 않았을 때는 이렇게 요청을 처리 했고, &lt;span style="color:#F08080;"&gt;기능이 100개라면 100개의 서블릿 클래스를 직접 만들고 일일이 설정 파일에 등록 해야 하는 노가다&lt;/span&gt;가 있었음&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Servlet&lt;/code&gt; : Java를 사용하여 웹페이지를 동적으로 생성하는 서버측 프로그램 (Tomcat 안에서 동작함)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx-relative hx-mt-6 first:hx-mt-0 hx-group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@WebServlet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;urlPatterns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;/user/login&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;UserLoginServlet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;extends&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;HttpServlet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@Override&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;protected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kt"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;doGet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;HttpServletRequest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;request&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;HttpServletResponse&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;response&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// ... &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx-opacity-0 hx-transition group-hover/code:hx-opacity-100 hx-flex hx-gap-1 hx-absolute hx-m-[11px] hx-right-0 hx-top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx-group/copybtn hx-transition-all active:hx-opacity-50 hx-bg-primary-700/5 hx-border hx-border-black/5 hx-text-gray-600 hover:hx-text-gray-900 hx-rounded-md hx-p-1.5 dark:hx-bg-primary-300/10 dark:hx-border-white/10 dark:hx-text-gray-400 dark:hover:hx-text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
&gt;
&lt;div class="copy-icon group-[.copied]/copybtn:hx-hidden hx-pointer-events-none hx-h-4 hx-w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="success-icon hx-hidden group-[.copied]/copybtn:hx-block hx-pointer-events-none hx-h-4 hx-w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;예전에 직접 Servlet설정하려면 위와 같이 코드를 짜야 했다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style="color:#87CEEB;"&gt;도입 후&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="도입-후"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#%eb%8f%84%ec%9e%85-%ed%9b%84" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-02-14.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="text-align: center; color: gray; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 20px;"&gt; 핵심 패턴인 Front Controller가 도입된 Spring MVC모습 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-overflow-x-auto hx-mt-6 hx-flex hx-rounded-lg hx-border hx-py-2 ltr:hx-pr-4 rtl:hx-pl-4 contrast-more:hx-border-current contrast-more:dark:hx-border-current hx-border-blue-200 hx-bg-blue-100 hx-text-blue-900 dark:hx-border-blue-200/30 dark:hx-bg-blue-900/30 dark:hx-text-blue-200"&gt;
&lt;div class="ltr:hx-pl-3 ltr:hx-pr-2 rtl:hx-pr-3 rtl:hx-pl-2"&gt;&lt;div class="hx-select-none hx-text-xl" style="font-family: 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';"&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-w-full hx-min-w-0 hx-leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-mt-6 hx-leading-7 first:hx-mt-0"&gt;Request(클라이언트 요청) -&amp;gt; DispatcherServlet(자동으로 요청 분석 및 길 안내) -&amp;gt; Controller(로직 처리) -&amp;gt; View -&amp;gt; Response(서버 응답)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;예전에는 수동으로 &lt;code&gt;Servlet&lt;/code&gt;을 하나하나 만들어 줘야 했다면, 지금의 스프링에서는 이렇게 &lt;span style="color:#87CEEB;"&gt;요청 맨 앞에 &lt;code&gt;DispatcherServlet&lt;/code&gt;을 두는 Front Controller패턴과 MVC패턴을 적용해 효율적으로 HTTP요청을 자동으로 처리&lt;/span&gt;하는 경지에 이른다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이제는 개발자가 모든 요청마다 &lt;code&gt;Servlet&lt;/code&gt;을 직접 작성하는 대신 &lt;code&gt;DispatcherServlet&lt;/code&gt;이 맨 앞에서 모든 요청을 받아 알맞은 Controller에게 전달한다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;DispatcherServlet&lt;/code&gt; : 맨 앞단에서 &lt;code&gt;Servlet&lt;/code&gt; 역할을 수행, Front Controller 패턴의 문지기&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;그렇게 어노테이션(&lt;code&gt;@Controller&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;@GetMapping&lt;/code&gt;)만 선언 해두면 &lt;code&gt;Servlet&lt;/code&gt;을 수동으로 만들 지 않아도 맨 앞단 &lt;code&gt;DispatcherServlet&lt;/code&gt;에 의해 자동으로 처리된다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;단, Controller단에서 계층 분리가 일어 날 수도 있음&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx-relative hx-mt-6 first:hx-mt-0 hx-group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@Controller&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@RequestMapping&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;/api&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;HelloController&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@GetMapping&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;/get&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@ResponseBody&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;get&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(){&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;GET Method 요청!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@PostMapping&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;/post&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nd"&gt;@ResponseBody&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;post&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(){&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;POST Method 요청!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx-opacity-0 hx-transition group-hover/code:hx-opacity-100 hx-flex hx-gap-1 hx-absolute hx-m-[11px] hx-right-0 hx-top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx-group/copybtn hx-transition-all active:hx-opacity-50 hx-bg-primary-700/5 hx-border hx-border-black/5 hx-text-gray-600 hover:hx-text-gray-900 hx-rounded-md hx-p-1.5 dark:hx-bg-primary-300/10 dark:hx-border-white/10 dark:hx-text-gray-400 dark:hover:hx-text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
&gt;
&lt;div class="copy-icon group-[.copied]/copybtn:hx-hidden hx-pointer-events-none hx-h-4 hx-w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="success-icon hx-hidden group-[.copied]/copybtn:hx-block hx-pointer-events-none hx-h-4 hx-w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;요즘 직접적인 Servlet설정 없이 위와 같이 코드를 짠다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Controller란?&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="controller란"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#controller%eb%9e%80" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Controller는 위에서 설명한 Spring MVC의 연장선이다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;도입 후 그림에 보이는 Controller의 역할이 해당 &lt;code&gt;@Controller&lt;/code&gt;라는 어노테이션을 선언해서 사용하는 것이다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-overflow-x-auto hx-mt-6 hx-flex hx-rounded-lg hx-border hx-py-2 ltr:hx-pr-4 rtl:hx-pl-4 contrast-more:hx-border-current contrast-more:dark:hx-border-current hx-border-orange-100 hx-bg-orange-50 hx-text-orange-800 dark:hx-border-orange-400/30 dark:hx-bg-orange-400/20 dark:hx-text-orange-300"&gt;
&lt;div class="ltr:hx-pl-3 ltr:hx-pr-2 rtl:hx-pr-3 rtl:hx-pl-2"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-w-full hx-min-w-0 hx-leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx-mt-6 hx-leading-7 first:hx-mt-0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;@Controller&lt;/code&gt; : 해당 클래스가 클라이언트의 웹 요청을 받아 처리하는 담당자임을 알림&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;@RequestMapping&lt;/code&gt; : 해당 클래스 내의 메서드들의 공통적인 최상위 경로를 묶음&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;@ResponseBody&lt;/code&gt; : 반환값을 화면 HTTP 응답 본문에 데이터(문자열, JSON 등) 직접 반환 (미사용 시, &amp;ldquo;GET Method 요청!.html&amp;rdquo; 라는 웹페이지 파일 찾으려 시도함)&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;@GetMapping&lt;/code&gt; : HTTP GET 방식의 클라이언트 요청&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;@PostMapping&lt;/code&gt; : HTTP POST 방식의 클라이언트 요청&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>[TIL] 단기심화 9기 2일차</title><link>https://tree6316mte.github.io/til/2026/2026-09-01/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tree6316mte.github.io/til/2026/2026-09-01/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-01-1.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="text-align: center; color: gray; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 20px;"&gt; 공지방에 뜬 코드카타 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;오늘부터는 코드카타라는 걸 하루에 한번씩 하는게 루틴에 추가되었고, 확인해보니 알고리즘 문제를 풀어서 제출하는 &lt;strong&gt;1일 ○알고리즘 문제풀기&lt;/strong&gt;같은 훈련인 것 같다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;그렇게 오늘은 코드카타 + 웹CS와 Java입문 강의와 함께 오늘 하루가 시작 되었다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-09-01-2.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="text-align: center; color: gray; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 20px;"&gt; 웹 CS와 Java 입문과 그 외 강의 사진 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;입문은 대체로 순조로웠다. 사실 C#을 만져봤기 때문에 Java 문법이랑 비슷한게 많아서 큰 차이가 있는 점만 적어 본다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Java가 C#와는 다른점&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="java가-c와는-다른점"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#java%ea%b0%80-c%ec%99%80%eb%8a%94-%eb%8b%a4%eb%a5%b8%ec%a0%90" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;Gereric&lt;/code&gt;으로 타입 선언 시 기본 자료형 사용 불가 (대문자인 Class형식으로 해줘야 함)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;Linq&lt;/code&gt;랑 비슷한 문법인 &lt;code&gt;Stream&lt;/code&gt;이라는 문법을 사용해서 &lt;code&gt;for&lt;/code&gt;나 &lt;code&gt;while&lt;/code&gt;반복문 없이 빌더 패턴 느낌으로 매개변수에 람다 식을 넣어서 데이터 가공 처리가 가능
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;사용가능한 자료구조 : List, Set, Queue, Deque, (Map은 배열은 별도 변환 필요)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;내일은 Java랑 좀 더 친숙해지기 위해서 알고리즘 문제를 Java로 몇개 풀면서 Spring에 대해 좀 봐야 할 것 같다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>[TIL] 단기심화 9기 1일차</title><link>https://tree6316mte.github.io/til/2026/2026-08-31/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tree6316mte.github.io/til/2026/2026-08-31/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-08-31-1.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="text-align: center; color: gray; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 20px;"&gt; 사이트에 있던 게임 서버 개발 트랙 사진 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://spartaclub.kr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;스파르타 코딩클럽&lt;/a&gt;에서 진행하는 내일배움캠프에서 게임 서버 개발을 신청 후 들어왔다.
국민 취업 지원 제도에는 &lt;span style="color:#87CEEB;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;심화_AI를 활용한 백엔드 아키텍처 심화 과정&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;으로 되어있다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이번이 처음이 아니라 유니티 7기 트랙을 수료하고 게임 서버 개발 트랙도 듣고싶어서 왔는데, 그래서 그런지 몰라도 첫날 조우한 조원들이 전부 전에 유니티 트랙을 들었던 분들로 구성되어 있다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;유니티 트랙에서는 반년 이상을 공부해야 수료했다면 이번에는 &lt;span style="color:#87CEEB;"&gt;7주만에 끝내는 단기 과정&lt;/span&gt;이라 정신이 없을수도 있을 것 같은 느낌이 든다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Slack에서 공지, Zoom으로 강의, Zep으로 자습하는 환경은 저번 트랙과 동일한 것 같다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;유니티 트랙과 들었던 것과 달라진게 있다면 &lt;span style="color:#87CEEB;"&gt;QR체크를 통한 출석 체크&lt;/span&gt;를 해야해서 저번보다 출석 체크 하는게 조금 번거로워 진 것 같다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;그리고 첫날에 IntelliJ Ultimate도 4개월 지급해주고, 나중에 Claude도 지급해준다는데, 이정도면 1.5개월 하고도 남는 기간이라 은근히 지원이 좋은 것 같기도 하다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;강의도 지급 되었는데&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://tree6316mte.github.io/images/til/2026/2026-08-31-2.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="text-align: center; color: gray; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 20px;"&gt; 4일만에 입문 완강이 목표 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;웹CS와 Java입문 강의가 지급되었고 &lt;strong&gt;8/31(월) ~ 9/3(목)&lt;/strong&gt; 4일만에 끝내야 한다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>